:: StoryTitle
The Glass Path

:: StoryData
{"ifid":"123E4567-E89B-42D3-A456-426614174000","start":"Start"}

:: Start
At dusk, a corridor divides around a glass wall. One door glows red; the other reflects the blue of the evening sky.

[[Open the red door->Red Ending]]
[[Open the blue door->Blue Ending]]

:: Red Ending [ending]
The red room is warm and bright. You decide that certainty was the thing you wanted tonight.

:: Blue Ending [ending]
The blue door opens onto cool air and a wider road. You leave without knowing where it ends.
